summary: Reviewers can now select overlapping annotations, collapse comments,
  keep semantic diff colors on hover, and synchronize split scrolling through
  settings. The npm package installs the agent skill without Git access.
  Verification records and deterministic quality reports distinguish author
  claims, current source, stale evidence and unavailable checks. The first
  scanner delivery supports ESLint and configured commands; optional adapters
  remain deferred.
